+
+## Ticket Metadata
+- Ticket ID: `KANBA-52`
+- Spec Key: `KB-P1-15`
+- Title: `[Phase 1 / Database] audit_object_links() 6-reason detector, invalid_object_link_audits & incremental triggers`
